OL,3,GNEWSACycle route to get all weather
OL,4,Aresurfacing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular cycling and walking route in
OL,7,FAshford is set to be resurfaced as part
OL,8,Fof plans to make it more accessible all
OL,9,Fyear round.
OL,11,FFunded by #150k from the Department for
OL,12,FTransport, the Colonel Stephens
OL,13,FGreenway is Tenterden's only designated
OL,14,Fcycle route and provides an important
OL,15,Ftraffic-free link between St Michael's
OL,16,Fand the town centre.
OL,18,FKnown locally as The Old Railway Track,
OL,19,Fthe plans will see 650m (2,133ft) of
OL,20,Fthe route resurfaced, making it easier
OL,21,Ffor people to use it in all weathers.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
